            "sid": "1CH 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho uDavide efika ku-Orinani, u-Orinani wabheka futhi wambona uDavide, waphuma esibuyeni wakhothama phambi kukaDavide ubuso bakhe bubheke phansi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.21",
