          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wayesethi ku-Orinani: “Nginike indawo yalesi sibuya ukuba ngakhele uJehova i-altare phezu kwayo; kumelwe unginike yona ngenani eliphelele, ukuze inhlupho yabantu ivinjwe.",
          "type": "text",
